// Pseudo state machine outline for Step Functions
{
  "Comment": "High-assurance document ingestion pipeline",
  "StartAt": "TriggerParallelProcessing",
  "States": {
    "TriggerParallelProcessing": {
      "Type": "Parallel",
      "Branches": [
        {
          "StartAt": "InvokeExtractor",
          "States": {
            "InvokeExtractor": {
              "Type": "Task",
              "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::lambda:invoke",
              "Parameters": {
                "FunctionName": "${ExtractorFunctionArn}",
                "Payload": { "s3Key.$": "$.detail.objectKey" }
              },
              "End": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "StartAt": "InvokeClassifier",
          "States": {
            "InvokeClassifier": {
              "Type": "Task",
              "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::lambda:invoke",
              "Parameters": {
                "FunctionName": "${ClassifierFunctionArn}",
                "Payload": { "s3Key.$": "$.detail.objectKey" }
              },
              "End": true
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "Next": "PersistOutputs"
    },
    "PersistOutputs": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::lambda:invoke",
      "Parameters": {
        "FunctionName": "${PersistFunctionArn}",
        "Payload": { "input.$": "$" }
      },
      "Next": "UpsertDynamoDB"
    },
    "UpsertDynamoDB": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::dynamodb:putItem",
      "Parameters": {
        "TableName": "${DocumentIndexTable}",
        "Item": {
          "documentId": { "S": "${uuid()}" },
          "s3Key": { "S": "$.s3Key" },
          "extractSummary": { "S": "$.extractor.summary" },
          "riskScore": { "N": "$.classifier.riskScore" },
          "flag": { "S": "$.classifier.flag" },
          "timestamp": { "S": "${aws.currentTimestamp}" }
        }
      },
      "End": true
    }
  }
}
```

## Implementation Considerations

| Component | Approach |
|-----------|----------|
| **Parallelism** | Use Step Functions Parallel state to invoke both endpoints concurrently |
| **Encryption** | KMS CMK with bucket key enabled; TLS 1.2+ in transit |
| **IAM** | Cross-account role with sts:AssumeRole and scoped SageMaker/S3/DynamoDB permissions |
| **Retries** | Exponential backoff (3 attempts) with exponential delay, DLQ for persistent failures |
| **Cost** | SageMaker Serverless for intermittent loads; S3 Intelligent-Tiering; payload compression |
| **Privacy** | Bucket policies blocking public access; CloudTrail logging; data retention lifecycle |
| **Observability** | X-Ray tracing, CloudWatch metrics for latency/error rates, SNS alerts for high-risk documents |

